Void-specific instructions:
============================

Each Minecraft version needs a specific Java version. Install the matching
JRE and select it in the instance settings:

  Minecraft 26.1 and newer      openjdk25-jre
  Minecraft 1.20.5 - 1.21.x     openjdk21-jre
  Minecraft 1.17 - 1.20.4       openjdk17-jre
  Minecraft 1.16.5 and older    openjdk8-jre

If you get an error message that includes "org.lwjgl.opengl.LinuxDisplay.getAvailableDisplayModes",
you may need to install xrandr.
